Z||000007||Patrick's Dad||01-11-2001||10:14 PM||||wt3: Ditto the tube amp thing. Maybe we can get a group purchase...?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  I came across something interesting while cruising on eBay. I think that it was, <A HREF="http://www.audiooasis.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.audiooasis.com</A>  -but I can't seem to pull it up right now. There were affordable tube amps there! Up until now, I've been mainly looking at Creek, but this looks interesting, although it could be another Jolida (Chinese tube amp), which don't seem to be what we'd want.... It just has to sound good and drive my Paradigms.<P>I listened to "Dirty Mind" last night. I can't wait to bring up the other box. It has Half Speed Mastered discs of EW&F, Holst, and some other fun stuff.<P>------------------<BR>This should work until my site comes online....   <IMG SRC="http://homestead.deja.com/user.rshuman/files/Tmh.jpg"> ||||reg||1
