Z||000020||batboy||01-13-2001||07:05 PM||||I still have lots of record albums, including limited edition colored vinyl ones and radio station promo albums. I bought my turntable new in 1978 and it still works fine. A few at a time, I'm digitally recording my rare albums that will probably never be release to CD. I have my turntable patched into the soundcard of my computer. I use recording software to save the analog signal as a .wav file to my harddrive, then finally, I can burn it to a CD.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/album2CD.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 01-13-2001).]||||reg||1
